Hi Søren,

I would like to apologise for my fellow Debian maintainer. As you may know, I
am the maintainer of your pbkrtest package which we have in Debian because
car depends on it.

I told my fellow, and too often over-eager, Debian maintainer that I (as a R
user and CRAN author) consider the R semantics fine -- R does what it does,
and here it does not differentiate between '-' and '.'.  No R bug as this is
documented, no need for a change.

